WHITE ROCK, BC / ACCESSWIRE / March 28, 2022 / TDG Gold Corp. (TSXV:TDG) (the "Company" or "TDG") is pleased to report results from four diamond drillholes (Figure 1) completed in the Creek and JM Zones at TDG's 100% owned, former producing Shasta gold-silver ("Au-Ag") project in the Toodoggone District, B.C.

DDH SH21-037 intersected: 26.2 metres ("m") of 1.81 grams per tonne ("g/t") gold and 24 g/t silver;

Including, 14.2 m of 3.10 g/t Au and 37 g/t Ag [3.55 g/t AuEq*] from 127.3 m to 141.5 m

WHITE ROCK, BC / ACCESSWIRE / March 21, 2022 / TDG Gold Corp. (TSXV:TDG) (the "Company" or "TDG") is pleased to report a 45.8 metre ("m") drill intercept of 1.00 gram per tonne ("g/t") gold ("Au") and 57 g/t silver ("Ag") [1.72 g/t AuEq*] from 35.5 m depth in hole SH21-030 within the Shasta Zone at TDG's former producing Shasta project in the Toodoggone District, B.C (Figure 1).

